    <title>Good Morning Football</title>
    <desc>NFL Network enters the morning show fray with a three-hour live presentation. Each day, &#34;Good Morning Football&#34; brings viewers up-to-the-minute breaking NFL news and local NFL stories on a national platform. The show features a combination of headline-making interviews and a discussion of a wide array of issues in the areas of sports, news and entertainment. By booking celebrity guests and opinionated national and local journalists -- and taking advantage of a close collaboration with all 32 NFL franchises -- &#34;Good Morning Football&#34; breaks out within and well beyond its time period.</desc>
